{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Night at the Planetarium", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Clear Blue Sky", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future, in spoken interactions or written texts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Defining Relative Clauses as Subject", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You need to use <span class=\"strong\">relative pronouns</span> in defining relative clauses. These <span class=\"strong\">pronouns</span> identify the noun you are giving information about.<br>Some <span class=\"strong\">relative pronouns</span> refer to the noun that is the subject of the sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\">relative pronouns</span> you can use to refer to <span class=\"underline\">people</span> are <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">who </span></span>and <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">that</span></span>.<br/>The <span class=\"strong\">relative pronouns</span> you can use to refer to <span class=\"underline\">things</span> are <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">which </span></span>and <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">that</span></span>. <br/>  The <span class=\"strong\">relative pronoun</span> you can use to show <span class=\"underline\">possession</span> is  <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">whose</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br><span class=\"italic\">It's about this guy <span class=\"strong\">who takes his monkey on the flight</span>. </span>(<span class=\"italic\">who</span> refers to \u201cthe guy\u201d)<br><span class=\"italic\">We can even go to the nearby theater <span class=\"strong\">that has the best popcorn in town</span>. </span>(<span class=\"italic\">that</span> refers to \u201cthe nearby theater\u201d)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Usage Note:</span> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Who</span></span> is more commonly used than <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">that</span></span> for people, and <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">that</span></span> is more commonly used than <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">which</span></span> for things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A common mistake when forming relative clauses is repeating the subject. You do not need to use the <span class=\"strong\">pronoun</span> again because the relative clause already identifies the noun.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp<span class=\"italic\">It's about this guy <span class=\"strong\">who </span><s>he</s> goes into space with his pet monkey.</br>&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp<span class=\"italic\">We can even go to the nearby theater <span class=\"strong\">that</span> <s>it</s> has the best popcorn in town.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Well, it's about a guy <span class=\"strong\">who</span> wants to go into space. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That sounds like a movie <span class=\"strong\">that</span> I would definitely watch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Well according to Rogers, <span class=\"strong\">whose</span> reviews I trust, the movie is a must see.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Explaining Your Opinion", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Sometimes when you discuss ideas with others, you may have very strong opinions about the topic. You may be very certain about what you believe and want to express that.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the expressions below to give strong opinions. You can see how they are different from the weaker opinions where the speaker sounds less certain.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Stronger Opinions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Weaker Opinions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I strongly believe that\u2026 <br>I'm sure that\u2026 <br>I'm absolutely/quite certain/convinced/sure that\u2026                                             <br>I have no doubt that\u2026 <br>I would definitely say\u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm not sure, but I think that\u2026 <br>I guess that\u2026 <br>I suppose that\u2026<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Well according to... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Remember that not everyone will share your opinion and sometimes strong opinions can offend others. Be aware of your tone of voice and the reactions of the listener.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " It also has a lot of comedic elements, which <span class=\"strong\">I'm convinced  you would enjoy</span>.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That sounds like a movie that <span class=\"strong\"> I would definitely watch</span>.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It's a sci-fi movie which <span class=\"strong\">I'm sure you'll like</span>.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inhabitable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fit for plant and animal life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They set out on exploring Mars, which they thought  was inhabitable. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about science fiction movies!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to chronicle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to record in detail; to report ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The movie chronicles their journey from Earth to Mars.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "review", "type": "name"}, {"content": " criticism or critique of a movie, book or work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What were the reviews like?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "matinee", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a movie or show that is scheduled in the afternoon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Let's go this Tuesday and catch the matinee.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a must-see", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a show, play or movie that is extremely good  or highly recommended", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Well according to Rogers, whose reviews I trust, the movie is a must-see.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sci-fi", "type": "name"}, {"content": "science fiction", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Star Wars is a sci-fi movie which I'm sure you'll like. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on YouTube and find an episode of <span class=\"italic\">Star Trek</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch it with English subtitles and take note of all the vocabulary related to space.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell a friend about the main events in the episode using some of the vocabulary from your notes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I watch, listen and read subtitles of an episode of <span class=\"italic\">Star Trek</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes on new vocabulary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I tell a friend about the episode.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catch", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to see or to not miss something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hey John, do you want to catch a movie with me tonight?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le01ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le01ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey John, do you want to catch a movie with me tonight? There's this great movie called, <span class=\"italic\">Mars, Monkey and Me</span>, which has been the most anticipated movie of this year.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh yeah. What kind of movie is it?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a sci-fi movie which I'm sure you'll like. We can even go to the nearby theater that has the best popcorn in town.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh really? I don't watch a lot of sci-fi movies, though. I spend most of my time watching comedies, which I find are always entertaining.  But do tell me a bit more about this movie. I might give this one a chance, which is not usual for me.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, it's about this guy who goes into space with his pet monkey, that he named Choco Chips. They set out on exploring Mars, which they thought  was inhabitable. The movie chronicles their journey from Earth to Mars. It has a lot of comedic elements, which I'm convinced  you would enjoy.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Wow! That sounds like a movie I would definitely watch. What were the reviews like?", "time": "37000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob02re2img04.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well according to Rogers, whose reviews I trust, the movie is a must-see.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: That sounds exciting! This is going to be my first sci-fi movie for the year. Let's go this Tuesday and catch the matinee.  That way you can save some money, which we will definitely need for popcorn. We can't watch a movie without popcorn now, can we?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Of course! Let's go!", "time": "60000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about science and leisure time.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss going out and socializing using words like <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span>. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain my opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you like sci-fi movies? Explain. ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would you ever travel into space? Why? Why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text